WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.490
May is National Nurse's Month,

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.480
a time to honor these special humans

3
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.180
who have dedicated their lives to helping other people.

4
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.410
And in honor of National Nurse's Month

5
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.640
we wanted to do a little something special

6
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.800
for a nurse who wanted some beauty advice.

7
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.090
Oh gosh! Do I love beauty and all things beauty!

8
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:19.923
Take a look.

9
00:00:19.923 --> 00:00:20.970
(audience applauding)

10
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.770 line:15%
Hi, my name's Katherine Altieri,

11
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.660 line:15%
and I'm from Staten Island, New York.

12
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.120
I'm an intensive care nurse

13
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.500 line:15%
at Staten Island University Hospital.

14
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.100
I initially majored in music

15
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.270
and never really thought about becoming a nurse

16
00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:34.360
but I was inspired by my brother, Dan,

17
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.240
who is also a nurse at the same hospital.

18
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.920
I work 12 hour shifts, four days a week.

19
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.980
When I'm at work, I'm a plain Jane.

20
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.460
I wear no makeup and I have my hair up in a bun.

21
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.170
When I'm outside of work I go full glam.

22
00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.760
Think winged eyeliner, shimmery eyeshadow

23
00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.390
and false eyelashes.

24
00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.010
My husband jokes around with me

25
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.080
that I either look like I'm ready to walk the red carpet

26
00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.150
or like I just rolled out of bed.

27
00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.240
Drew, can you help a nurse out?

28
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.250
I'd love to learn to get an everyday look

29
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.880
that's natural, quick and easy

30
00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.710
and doesn't take too much time to do

31
00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:10.407
and makes me feel beautiful inside and out of the hospital.

32
00:01:10.407 --> 00:01:12.232
(audience cheering)

33
00:01:12.232 --> 00:01:15.480
I so relate. I really do.

34
00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.850
I think we all, a lot of us live in extremes.

35
00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.730
I feel like I get very together for work,

36
00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:24.930
and then in real life, it's a hot mess.

37
00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.680
So boy, does this speak to me!

38
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:31.350 line:15%
And this morning we worked with my friends at Maybelline,

39
00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.530 line:15%
along with their amazing makeup artists, Jenna Christina

40
00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:38.110 line:15%
to show Catherine how to get that every day look.

41
00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.853
So, let's check that out.

42
00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.067
Hi, ladies!

43
00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.430
Hi!
Hi, Drew.

44
00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:46.640
I am so excited to be doing this with you.

45
00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.330
Jenna and Catherine, I am thrilled.

46
00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.670
So, Catherine normally likes to do nothing

47
00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.670
or go all the way.

48
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.320
So today we're gonna scale her back

49
00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.890 line:15%
and do a more natural makeover,

50
00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.660 line:15%
something that's approachable to wear every day.

51
00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.600
Catherine, why do you think that you're an extremist?

52
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.030
'Cause I am too. I'm very all or nothing.

53
00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.220
But why are you like that?

54
00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:10.080
You know what, I feel like it's almost like an alter ego.

55
00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.393
Nurse by day, rockstar by night.

56
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.930
That's really kind of me in a nutshell.

57
00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.930
I am a makeup junkie through and through.

58
00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:19.900
Yes.
I always have been.

59
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.510
I grew up in a makeup chair as a little girl

60
00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:26.480
and I watched women transform and stand more empowered,

61
00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.440
and to me, that's what beauty is, it's a feeling.

62
00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.590
And I'd love to know what you're planning on doing today.

63
00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.970
I'm gonna do a makeover on Catherine

64
00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.060
using Maybelline New York's Green Edition.

65
00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.020
It's high performing makeup,

66
00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:42.010 line:15%
with a high percentage of natural origin ingredients.

67
00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:46.710
The packaging is made with up to 95% recycled material,

68
00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:49.500
and the formulas are clean and vegan.

69
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.190 line:15%
We all have our eyes open to how important being eco

70
00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.890 line:15%
and green and planet friendly.

71
00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:59.440 line:15%
So, I applaud Maybelline for this line.

72
00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.540 line:15%
This is really beautiful.

73
00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:01.490 line:15%
I'm going back in

74
00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.210 line:15%
with the lighter shade right under your eyes

75
00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.300
to brighten it up.

76
00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.670
If you put one shade all over your face

77
00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.480
then you're just flattening it.

78
00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.880
So, there's no depth or dimension.

79
00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:10.713 line:15%
Exactly!

80
00:03:10.713 --> 00:03:13.330 line:15%
A little highlighter, a little contour,

81
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.660 line:15%
a little something lighter under the eyes,

82
00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.090
a little something darker on the jawline.

83
00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.360
'Cause I lost my jawline a few years ago.

84
00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.380
It just took off.

85
00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.220
Oh my God! I hope you find her one day.

86
00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.410
I don't think so.

87
00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.595
I think she went on permanent vacation.

88
00:03:26.595 --> 00:03:28.810
(Jena and Catherine laughing)

89
00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:31.380
Okay, so next, it's buildable volume.

90
00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:34.380
So, if you want a natural look, you can put one coat on.

91
00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.820
If you want a little bit more volume,

92
00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.530
you can just add a couple more.

93
00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.750
This is really nice because it has mango oil in it.

94
00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.230
It has lasting hydration.

95
00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.263
Your lips are going to feel and look really smooth.

96
00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.980
And I really need this

97
00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.940
because I'm just in a mask all day,

98
00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:53.380
and I'm super dry all the time.

99
00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.360
So, we're gonna do a big reveal on the stage.

100
00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.530
I'm so excited to do that with you guys.

101
00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.460
Catherine, are you feeling good about that?

102
00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.730
Yes, and my hair's not gonna be in a bun for once.

103
00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.410
You're gonna style it and come out full force?

104
00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.840
I'm gonna actually,

105
00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:10.610
literally let my hair down and figuratively.

106
00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.980
I am gonna be out there waiting for you,

107
00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.690
ready to embrace you and show you off.

108
00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.270
And Jenna, I'm so excited to see what you're gonna do

109
00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:19.770
with this extraordinary line.

110
00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:21.025
I can't wait to see everything.

111
00:04:21.025 --> 00:04:23.608 line:15%
(upbeat music)

